BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_316984584@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052551Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T210000
SUMMARY:Tichu Tuesday
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\n**Join us at Gamers Geekery & T
 avern for a friendly\, competitive game of Tichu.**\n\n**For those interes
 ted in learning the game we'll have a teaching session from 6 - 6:30.**\n\
 n**We'll move to partners and scoring at 6:30.**\n\nPrimarily classified a
 s a shedding game that includes elements of Bridge\, Daihinmin\, and Poker
 \, Tichu is played between two teams of two players each. Special cards\, 
 the Dragon and Phoenix have special powers and there are tons of strategy 
 decisions to make.\n\n**Venue fee $2.50/person. Please support our host ve
 nue by purchasing food and beverage.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 316984584/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261014T225627Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T225627Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_317017658@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052551Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T230000
SUMMARY:Play Board Games at the Geekery
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nCome play games at Gamers Geeke
 ry and Tavern every thursday night!\n\nStarting time is 6:30\, but feel fr
 ee to come in anytime and just hang out for the night. Group is very casua
 l and friendly.\n\nHow it works:\nCome on in\, grab a name tag and pay the
  $2.50 meetup participant fee at the bar area\, find the tables that are r
 eserved for the Meetup group\, play games with others who show up. Food an
 d drinks are available at the bar.\n\nPlease RSVP by noon day of. If less 
 than four people are able to attend a given Wednesday the event will be ca
 nceled.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 317017658/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261016T230126Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261016T230126Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
