DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T190000
SUMMARY:Play Games at Gamers Geekery!
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\n**Official event times are 4pm 
 until 7pm\, but you are welcome to stay as long as you want.**\n\n**How it
  works. Come on in\, grab a name tag at the bar area\, find the tables tha
 t are reserved for the Meetup group.**\n\n**The $2.50 fee can be paid to t
 he venue by talking to any of the bartenders. Please support our host venu
 e and purchase food and drink.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 317026812/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261017T181300Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T181300Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
